rentalot properties list — List properties

Usage:
  rentalot properties list [flags]

Flags:
      --bedroom-type string  filter by bedroom type (only studio; studios have zero bedrooms)
      --filter string  filter as key=value (e.g. status=active)
  -h, --help  help for list
      --limit int  max results to return
      --output string  output format: table or json (--json also selects JSON) (default "table")
      --page int  page number (1-based)
      --property-type stringArray  filter by canonical property type (repeat for multiple)

Global Flags:
      --config string  config file (default "<CONFIG_FILE>")
      --json  output as JSON
      --no-color  disable colored output
      --timeout duration  HTTP request timeout, including response body (must be positive) (default 30s)

